OpenCLI
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The per-site mini-CLIs under `openseer/site_cli/` are Python ports of
site adapters from the OpenCLI project:

    https://github.com/JackWener/OpenCLI
    Copyright (c) 2024-2025 OpenCLI contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Specifically:

  openseer/site_cli/arxiv.py      ←  OpenCLI/clis/arxiv/{search,paper,recent,utils}.js
  openseer/site_cli/bilibili.py   ←  OpenCLI/clis/bilibili/{search,hot,video,utils}.js

Ported from OpenCLI commit 0c488bbf. We preserved OpenCLI's site
adapter design intent (browser-as-fetch-wrapper, WBI signing inside
the page context, public-API extraction patterns) and adapted it to
OpenSeer's existing CDP layer (openseer/browser_cdp.py). The
TypeScript code was not vendored — each ported module is a Python
rewrite that depends only on OpenSeer's internal modules.

Each ported file carries an in-source attribution header naming the
specific OpenCLI source paths it derives from.
